cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this code or the benchmark it generates, please cite the paper below.
title: "SDF_3: learning implicit design rules from BIM geometry"
abstract: >-
  Code and per-experiment reproduction scripts for a controlled study in which a graph
  transformer infers where along its host wall an omitted door belongs, from
  pose-conditioned neural signed distance function embeddings and IFC topology alone,
  with coordinates withheld and evaluation restricted to unseen rigid transforms.
type: software
